      "text": {
        "type": "translation",
        "key": "item.melee.tanto_pathfinder.description",
        "args": {},
        "lines": {
          "ru": "Необычный нож, найденный среди снаряжения разгромленных бойцов из отряда Первопроходцев. Такая приметная вещица явно побывала в самых загадочных уголках Зоны!",
          "en": "An unusual knife found among the equipment of the defeated fighters from the Trailblazers squad. This distinctive item has clearly been to the most mysterious corners of the Zone!",
          "es": "An unusual knife found among the equipment of the defeated fighters from the Trailblazers squad. This distinctive item has clearly been to the most mysterious corners of the Zone!",
          "fr": "Un couteau rare, retrouvé parmi l'équipement des soldats défaits de l'escouade des Pionniers. Un objet aussi singulier a forcément vu les coins les plus mystérieux de la Zone !",
          "ko": "패배를 모르는 개척자 분대의 전사들 사이에서 찾아볼 수 있는 독특한 칼이다. 이 독특한 아이템은 분명히 구역의 가장 신비로운 곳들을 거쳤을 것이다!"
        }
      }
    }
